{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-title",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Aplicação da Transformada de Fourier Discreta\n",
    "\n",
    "**FFT — Fast Fourier Transform**\n",
    "\n",
    "Domínio do tempo → Domínio da frequência\n",
    "\n",
    "**Pacote Python:** `scipy.fft`  \n",
    "[https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/tutorial/fft.html](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/tutorial/fft.html)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Bibliografia:** Fujarra, A. L. C. (2009) "Dinâmica de Sistemas II — Material de Apoio" EPUSP, SP"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-exercise",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Exercício\n",
    "\n",
    "Utilizar a FFT para gerar o espectro de energia $S_\\zeta(\\omega)$ de uma onda regular\n",
    "com amplitude $A = 2\\,\\text{m}$ e $T = 2\\,\\text{s}$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-step1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Passo 1 — Série Temporal\n",
    "\n",
    "- $A_i$ — Amplitude da componente de onda $i$;\n",
    "- $\\omega_i$ — frequência angular da componente de onda $i$;\n",
    "- $\\psi_i$ — fase da componente de onda $i$;\n",
    "\n",
    "$$y(t) = \\sum_{i=1}^{\\infty} A_i \\cdot \\sin(\\omega_i t + \\psi_i)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Lembrando que $\\omega_i = \\dfrac{2\\pi}{T_i}$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-example",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Exemplo — Onda regular** (uma única frequência e amplitude)\n",
    "\n",
    "- Amplitude: $A = 2$ m\n",
    "- Período: $T = 2$ s\n",
    "- Frequência: $f = \\frac{1}{T} = 0.5$ Hz\n",
    "- Frequência angular: $\\omega = \\frac{2\\pi}{2} = \\pi$ rad/s\n",
    "\n",
    "Equação: $y(t) = 2\\sin(\\pi t)$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-imports",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import matplotlib\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "matplotlib.style.use('ggplot')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-wave",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "N = 501\n",
    "A = 2\n",
    "T = 2\n",
    "N_ciclos = 10\n",
    "\n",
    "t0 = 0\n",
    "tf = N_ciclos * T\n",
    "t = np.linspace(t0, tf, N)\n",
    "\n",
    "w = 2 * np.pi / T\n",
    "y = A * np.sin(w * t)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-plot-wave",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4), dpi=100, facecolor='w', edgecolor='k')\n",
    "plt.plot(t, y, '-')\n",
    "plt.grid()\n",
    "plt.xlabel('t [s]')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('y(t) [m]')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-sigma",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$\\sigma$ — Desvio padrão do sinal\n",
    "\n",
    "$A = \\sqrt{2}\\,\\sigma$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-std",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "A_ = np.sqrt(2) * np.std(y)\n",
    "print(A_)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-step2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Passo 2 — Cálculo da FFT\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\Delta f = \\frac{1}{t_f - t_0}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-fft",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from scipy.fft import fft\n",
    "\n",
    "yf = fft(y)\n",
    "zeta_a = np.abs(yf) / N\n",
    "\n",
    "Delta_f = 1 / (tf - t0)\n",
    "vetor_f = np.arange(N) * Delta_f"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-plot-fft",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4), dpi=100, facecolor='w', edgecolor='k')\n",
    "plt.plot(vetor_f, zeta_a)\n",
    "plt.xlabel('f [Hz]')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('A [m]')\n",
    "plt.text(1 / T, A / 2, str(1 / T) + ' Hz', horizontalalignment='center')\n",
    "plt.text(\n",
    "    vetor_f[-1] - 1 / T,\n",
    "    A / 2,\n",
    "    str(vetor_f[-1] - 1 / T) + ' Hz',\n",
    "    horizontalalignment='center',\n",
    ")\n",
    "plt.grid()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-step3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Passo 3 — Remoção das Frequências de Aliasing\n",
    "\n",
    "**Frequência de amostragem:** $f_S = (N-1)\\,\\Delta f$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Frequência de aliasing:** $f_A = f_S - f$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-fs",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fs = (N - 1) * Delta_f\n",
    "fs"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-aliasing-demo",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "t_continuo = np.linspace(t0, tf, N * 100)\n",
    "\n",
    "w_interesse = 2 * np.pi * 1 / T\n",
    "el_interesse = A / 2 * np.sin(w_interesse * t_continuo)\n",
    "\n",
    "w_aliasing = 2 * np.pi * (fs - 1 / T)\n",
    "el_aliasing = -A / 2 * np.sin(w_aliasing * t_continuo)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 5), dpi=100, facecolor='w', edgecolor='k')\n",
    "plt.plot(t_continuo, el_interesse, 'b', label='Comportamento Contínuo De Interesse')\n",
    "plt.plot(t_continuo, el_aliasing, 'r', label='Comportamento Contínuo SEM Interesse')\n",
    "plt.plot(t, y / 2, 'k.', label='Sinal Discreto')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('t [s]')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Elevação [m]')\n",
    "plt.xlim((0, 3))\n",
    "plt.ylim((-2, 2))\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-cutoff",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Frequência de corte:** $f_c = \\dfrac{f_S}{2}$\n",
    "\n",
    "- O vetor de amplitudes e frequências deve ser cortado ao meio;\n",
    "- A amplitude deve ser multiplicada por 2;\n",
    "- A frequência de amostragem deve ser no mínimo 2× a frequência de interesse.\n",
    "\n",
    "No presente caso a frequência de interesse é 0.5 Hz, logo é necessária amostragem\n",
    "de no mínimo 1 Hz (na prática adota-se valores bem maiores: 10×, 100×)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-cut-aliasing",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "zeta_a = 2 * zeta_a[: N // 2]\n",
    "vetor_f = vetor_f[: N // 2]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-plot-clean",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4), dpi=100, facecolor='w', edgecolor='k')\n",
    "plt.plot(vetor_f, zeta_a)\n",
    "plt.xlabel('f [Hz]')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('A [m]')\n",
    "plt.text(1 / T, A, str(1 / T) + ' Hz', horizontalalignment='center')\n",
    "plt.grid()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-step4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Passo 4 — Espectro de Energia\n",
    "\n",
    "$$S_{\\zeta}(f) = \\frac{[\\zeta_a]^2}{2\\,\\Delta f} \\quad [\\text{m}^2\\text{s}]$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-spectrum-f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "Sf = (zeta_a**2) / (2 * Delta_f)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4), dpi=100, facecolor='w', edgecolor='k')\n",
    "plt.plot(vetor_f, Sf)\n",
    "plt.xlabel('f [Hz]')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('S(f) [m^2.s]')\n",
    "plt.text(1 / T, np.max(Sf), str(1 / T) + ' Hz', horizontalalignment='center')\n",
    "plt.grid()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-amplitude-rel",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$A = \\sqrt{2}\\,\\sigma$\n",
    "\n",
    "$\\sigma^2 = \\int_0^\\infty S_\\zeta(f)\\,df = m_0$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-m0-f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "m0 = np.trapezoid(Sf, vetor_f)\n",
    "\n",
    "Desvio_padrao = np.sqrt(m0)\n",
    "A = np.sqrt(2) * Desvio_padrao\n",
    "\n",
    "print(A)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-angular-freq",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Espectro de Energia — Frequência Angular\n",
    "\n",
    "$$S_\\zeta(\\omega)\\,\\Delta\\omega = S_\\zeta(f)\\,\\Delta f$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\Delta\\omega = 2\\pi\\,\\Delta f \\qquad \\Rightarrow \\qquad S_\\zeta(\\omega) = \\frac{S_\\zeta(f)}{2\\pi}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-spectrum-w",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "Delta_w = 2 * np.pi * Delta_f\n",
    "vetor_w = 2 * np.pi * vetor_f\n",
    "\n",
    "Sw = Sf / (2 * np.pi)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 4), dpi=100, facecolor='w', edgecolor='k')\n",
    "plt.plot(vetor_w, Sw)\n",
    "plt.xlabel('w [rad/s]')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('S(w) [m^2.s]')\n",
    "plt.text(w, np.max(Sw), '{:.2f}'.format(w) + ' rad/s', horizontalalignment='center')\n",
    "plt.grid()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-amplitude-w",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$A = \\sqrt{2}\\,\\sigma$\n",
    "\n",
    "$\\sigma^2 = \\int_0^\\infty S_\\zeta(\\omega)\\,d\\omega = m_0$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-m0-w",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "m0_w = np.trapezoid(Sw, vetor_w)\n",
    "\n",
    "Desvio_padrao_w = np.sqrt(m0_w)\n",
    "A_w = np.sqrt(2) * Desvio_padrao_w\n",
    "\n",
    "print(A_w)"
   ]
  }
 ],
